<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch postpone economic indicators until Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Dutch postpone economic indicators until Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said two economic indicators originally scheduled for publication on Tuesday would now be published on Wednesday because of technical problems.</p>
<p>The two indicators affected by the postponement are the September business confidence index and September manufacturing capacity utilisation rate.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
